    <para id="para-00024">What were the window values you used for the \(y\)-axis? (Write the values as an inequality.)</para>
    </problem><solution id="sol-00008">
    
    
  
  <para id="para-00025">Compare your answer:</para>
    
    <para id="para-00026">\(-15 \leq y \leq 150\)</para>
  
